From be03233c56430c39e506006f76df5ab937ef16f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Torbj=C3=B6rn=20SVENSSON?= <torbjorn.svensson@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:10:47 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] testsuite: Fix excess errors in vect-pr127876-1.c [PR127876]
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add -fno-associative-math to avoid a warning when -fsigned-zeros
conflicts with the ARM NEON testsuite's -ffast-math.

gcc/testsuite/ChangeLog:

	PR tree-optimization/127876
	* gcc.dg/vect/vect-pr127876-1.c: Add -fno-associative-math.

Signed-off-by: Torbjörn SVENSSON <torbjorn.svensson@foss.st.com>
(cherry picked from commit d80deed256650bf0b0ac14dc599b77500992115e)
---
 gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/vect/vect-pr127876-1.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/vect/vect-pr127876-1.c b/gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/vect/vect-pr127876-1.c
index 5fd783383e32..5dc099b7e38d 100644
--- a/gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/vect/vect-pr127876-1.c
+++ b/gcc/testsuite/gcc.dg/vect/vect-pr127876-1.c
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-/* { dg-additional-options "-fsigned-zeros" } */
+/* { dg-additional-options "-fno-associative-math -fsigned-zeros" } */
 
 #include "tree-vect.h"
 
